      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Use <code>encodeURIComponent</code> when encoding individual query string keys or values to safely escape reserved characters like <code>&amp;</code>, <code>=</code>, and <code>?</code>. Use <code>encodeURI</code> only when encoding a complete URL address where protocol and query delimiters must remain unencoded. All processing is debounced and performed entirely in your browser.</p>
