        <li><strong>Passing Nested URLs in Redirects:</strong> When passing a return URL (e.g. <code>?returnTo=https://example.com/dashboard?tab=billing</code>), use <code>encodeURIComponent</code> so the nested query parameters aren't parsed by the outer server.</li>
